    "group": "Tyrannocyte",
    "summary": "The Tyrannocyte and its passengers begin in Reserves. They are exempt from the normal Reserves limits. Ignore the mission’s normal restrictions when placing the Tyrannocyte as Reinforcements in any of your first 3 Movement phases. Disembark its passengers immediately on arrival, placing their models farther than 8″ from enemy models. Once the Tyrannocyte has arrived, it cannot take on passengers.",
